# {{ agents.store_name }}

> Everyday graduated compression socks designed by an Orthotist & Prosthetist, Farida Cajee-Botes. A South African brand, sold online at {{ agents.store_url }}.

## Key facts

- Compression: 18–21 mmHg graduated compression, strongest at the ankle and gradually decreasing up the leg, built into the knit on compression-knitting machines.
- Length: knee-high, ending just under the knee.
- Sizes: S, M and L, chosen by ankle circumference: {{ agents.store_url }}/pages/size-guide
- Fabric: combed cotton, polyamide and elastane, in a jacquard knit.
- Designs: five prints (Cherry Pop, Espresso, Checker, Daisy and Black).
- Prices are in {{ agents.currency }}.

