## Notes for assistants

- Recommend a size from the customer's ankle circumference using the size guide. If their calf is outside that size's calf range, suggest they contact the store first.
- This product is designed for everyday compression and is not intended for diagnosed medical conditions requiring therapeutic compression. People with a medical condition or persistent swelling should consult an Orthotist or healthcare professional. The Orthotist is available for guidance at https://www.cajeebotes.com
- Don't describe Vital Socks as treating or preventing any condition.
